- notifications;
{% if features.ai_assistant %}
- the assistant;
{% endif %}
- feedback;
- updates.

## 4. Who receives your data

- **{{ platform.short }}** operates the platform for {{ rec.short }}, as processor.
- **{{ platform.short }}' sub-processors**, listed in the platform's sub-processor list:
  - {{ providers.hosting.name }}, for hosting in the European Union;
  - an email delivery provider {{ providers.email.name }};
{% if features.sms_verification %}
  - {{ providers.sms.name }}, {{ providers.sms.country.en }}, for verification SMS.
{% endif %}
- **{{ providers.maps.name }}**: receives your supply address to locate it on the map,
  without your name.
- **{{ rec.short }}'s staff**, as far as their role requires:
  - the members list shows community managers your name, your meters and your
    consumption aggregates.
- **GSE**, and the other recipients listed in {{ rec.short }}'s general privacy notice for
  members, for the management of the community.

Your data is not published and not sold.

