## 6. How long we keep it

| Data | Kept for |
|---|---|
| Application that is not accepted, or withdrawn | 12 months from the decision |
| Application of an admitted member, account, app data | For the duration of membership, then as in {{ rec.short }}'s general privacy notice for members (5 years from the end of membership) |
{% if features.document_extraction %}
| Copies of the bill and identity document uploaded with the application | Until your account is activated. For an application that is not accepted, as the application |
{% endif %}
{% if features.sms_verification %}
| SMS verification codes | 24 hours |
{% endif %}
| Login and security records | 12 months |
| Notifications and their delivery records | 12 months |
{% if features.ai_assistant %}
| AI assistant conversations and attachments | Until you delete them, and at most 12 months after the last message |
{% endif %}
| Feedback, including screenshots | 12 months |
| Records of acceptances and consents | For the duration of membership and 5 years after it ends, or after the consent is withdrawn |
| Address for updates | Until you withdraw consent |

## 7. Cookies and local storage

The platform uses only what it needs to work:

- a **session cookie** that keeps you logged in, removed when you log out or when the
  session expires;
- your browser's **local storage**, for your language and light or dark theme.

There are no analytics, advertising or profiling cookies, so no cookie consent is
asked.

## 8. Your rights

You can ask {{ rec.short }} for:

- access to your data;
- its rectification or erasure;
- restriction of processing;
- portability of the data you provided.

You can also object to processing based on legitimate interest (Articles 15–22 GDPR).

**How to ask:** write to **{{ rec.privacy_contact }}**. You will receive an
answer within one month.

**In the app** you can yourself:

{% if features.ai_assistant %}
- delete your assistant conversations and attachments;
{% endif %}
- change your notification settings{{ ';' if features.dso_data_exchange else '.' }}
{% if features.dso_data_exchange %}
- change your data-sharing choices.
{% endif %}

You can also lodge a complaint with the Garante per la protezione dei dati personali,
Piazza Venezia 11, 00187 Roma, www.garanteprivacy.it.

## 9. Changes

When this notice changes, the platform shows you the new version at your next login.
The version and date are at the top of this notice.
